"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Simple Shot Timer never uses the camera. Film your string with the Camera app, then choose the video in Simple Shot Timer.";
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "Simple Shot Timer listens through the microphone to detect your shots and time your splits. The sound is analysed on your phone and never recorded or sent anywhere.";
"NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription" = "Simple Shot Timer saves the videos you export with your times to your photos. It never reads your library.";
